OL,3,GNEWSABypass work to start after
OL,4,Acontractor appointed
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to build the next phase of a
OL,7,Flong-awaited bypass which will connect
OL,8,FScunthorpe's southern motorway junction
OL,9,Fto the rest of the town is due to begin
OL,10,F"in the coming days", North
OL,11,FLincolnshire Council has said.
OL,13,FContractor Applebridge has been
OL,14,Fappointed to work on the Burringham
OL,15,FBypass, which is expected to be
OL,16,Fcompleted early next summer.
OL,18,FThe move follows planning approval for
OL,19,Fthe scheme being granted in July and
OL,20,Fthe funding being agreed through the
OL,21,Fcouncil.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
