OL,3,GNEWSABypass work to start after
OL,4,Acontractor appointed
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Rob Waltham said: "The
OL,7,Fpace is really beginning to quicken and
OL,8,Fit's fantastic to see another major
OL,9,Fpiece of infrastructure moving towards
OL,10,Fconstruction."
